 placement to playing cards in your mode of choice, there are many variables in Recitallion that let you find your own way of winning.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323310/extras/e586b882da0b30bbcbdb8fdca627e421.poster.avif?t=1738349327\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323310/extras/e586b882da0b30bbcbdb8fdca627e421.webm?t=1738349327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323310/extras/e586b882da0b30bbcbdb8fdca627e421.mp4?t=1738349327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323310/extras/396460c9a1d38d63fb702e3e782b477b.avif?t=1738349327\" data-has-big width=800 height=103 /></span><strong>Manage your Deck, Manage your Life:\u00a0</strong>Your deck of cards is very limited, and if you end up out of cards, your hp will start draining. To help manage this deck is Summon Theft: by destroying an opponent\u2019s summon, you can get the corresponding card added to your deck.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323310/extras/9100a3c44082e08094582fe60479e1db.poster.avif?t=1738349327\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323310/extras/9100a3c44082e08094582fe60479e1db.webm?t=1738349327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3323310/extras/9100a3c44082e08094582f